id: dynamic
name: Dynamic
kind: karma
cost: dynamic
manual: yes
description: >
  You can do anything!
text: >
  You can request anything from your ARC - it may be a potential bonus, a
  change to the narrative, the ability to do something outside the bounds of
  your Maneuvers, or otherwise. This Karmic Effect may include a Challenge
  (when Adventuring) or another form of Clash/Check while in a Combat
  Encounter, but ultimately it is down to you and your ARC's creativity to
  bring your thoughts to life through this Karmic Effect.

---

# No script, and not for want of one: what this does is whatever the ARC
# agrees to. The system spends the Karma Points and announces it, which is
# the whole of what it can honestly do here.
# The cost is asked for when it is taken, since the ARC sets it.
